  "notes": "USAGE:\nCan be used as a noun or as a suru verb ({和訳|わやく}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧). Commonly contrasted with ⟦{英訳|えいやく}→英訳：16317_eiyaku⟧ (translation into English).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {和訳|わやく}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to translate into Japanese)\n- {和訳|わやく}{版|ばん} (Japanese-translated version)\n- ⟦{直訳|ちょくやく}→直訳：13629_chokuyaku⟧⟦と→と：00512_to⟧{和訳|わやく} (literal translation and Japanese translation)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{英訳|えいやく}→英訳：16317_eiyaku⟧: translation into English\n- ⟦{意訳|いやく}→意訳：17846_iyaku⟧: free or liberal translation\n- ⟦{直訳|ちょくやく}→直訳：13629_chokuyaku⟧: literal translation",
